"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years. In 2025 the middle got 30% of normal in February to March and 45% of normal in August to September. Grid 14520 had its driest year in 2011, at 39% of normal.</p>"}
